{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d151c99e-0b6f-8c5f-9d08-abc860fddf6c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T14:41:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leila Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:37:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I think I might have the wrong department, but I'm calling about a dog. Sort of an animal control thing, maybe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:38:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me hear what's going on, and I'll tell you where it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's a dog tied up outside, I think in a front yard, and it's been out there, maybe, two or three hours now. It's pretty cold today. I think it's below freezing still."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is the dog at a house near you, or is it your own property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's not mine. I'm sort of the landlord of the building next to it. I own a place and I was just stopping by to check on something. The dog is, I think, at the house beside mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:38:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you give me the address where the dog is, or the one closest to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:38:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I think the dog's house is maybe 327, but I'm not totally sure about the number. My building is 325 Ayrault Street. So it's right next door, I think on the right side if you're facing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. 325 Ayrault Street, and the dog is next door to that. Let me write that down. Slow down for me a second, I'm just getting it on the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:39:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Can you describe the dog for me? Size, color, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, I think, a medium-size dog, maybe brown or tan. It has a rope or a chain, I can't quite tell. There's maybe a bowl nearby, but I can't see if there's water in it. I don't see a doghouse, sort of, but there could be one behind the steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is the dog barking, or does it seem to be in distress at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think it's mostly just standing there. Maybe shivering a little? I'm not certain. I'm not close enough to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:39:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful. Is there anything else about the property that would help an officer find the right spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I think the neighbor keeps a very tidy garden, even in winter. Like, everything's trimmed and the beds are all neat. So the yard is sort of easy to pick out, because the dog is the only thing out of place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that the yard is well kept. That does help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask who actually responds to this? Is it the police, or is it, like, a separate animal person?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:40:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes to the animal control officer. If the officer isn't available, the police department can send someone out. I'm going to pass this along to them now with the address and the description you gave me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:40:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do they, maybe, call me back? I think I'd want to know if somebody went."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:40:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can include a callback number. What number should I put?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:40:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0159."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-nine. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, Ms. Kim. I've got it down. I can't say exactly when they'll get there, but it's going to them this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:41:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
